  {
    "id": "sec_b_h1",
    "title": "Section B — Hypothesis 1",
    "description": "H1: Academic business incubators provide mentorship based on 'Lean Start-up Theory,' which increases the market survival rate of the incubated start-ups.",
    "questions": [
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q 1",
        "number": "Q 1",
        "text": "Mentors at our incubator heavily teach \"Lean Start-up\" ideas, like testing early products and learning from customer feedback.",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Rarely or never",
          "B) Occasionally",
          "C) Frequently",
          "D) Always"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q 2",
        "number": "Q 2",
        "text": "Using Lean strategies like knowing when to change direction (pivot) helps our start-ups stay in business longer.",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Strongly Disagree",
          "B) Disagree",
          "C) Agree",
          "D) Strongly Agree"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q 3",
        "number": "Q 3",
        "text": "Start-ups that follow the Lean advice given by their mentors handle market challenges and changes much better.",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Not at all effectively",
          "B) Slightly effectively",
          "C) Moderately effectively",
          "D) Extremely effectively"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q 4",
        "number": "Q 4",
        "text": "Regular mentor advice focused on customer feedback helps start-ups build products that people actually want to buy.",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Not at all",
          "B) To a small extent",
          "C) To a moderate extent",
          "D) To a great extent"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q5",
        "number": "Q5",
        "text": "Start-ups using Lean methods fail much less often compared to those using old-fashioned, traditional business planning.",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Much higher failure rate",
          "B) Same failure rate",
          "C) Lower failure rate",
          "D) Much lower failure rate"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q6",
        "number": "Q6",
        "text": "How often do mentors encourage your startup to validate business ideas with potential customers before making major investments?",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Never",
          "B) Occasionally",
          "C) Frequently",
          "D) Always"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q7",
        "number": "Q7",
        "text": "To what extent has mentorship on developing a Minimum Viable Product (MVP) helped your startup reduce the risk of product failure?",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Not at all",
          "B) To a small extent",
          "C) To a moderate extent",
          "D) To a great extent"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q8",
        "number": "Q8",
        "text": "How effective has mentor guidance been in helping your startup quickly adapt its business model based on market feedback?",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) Not effective",
          "B) Slightly effective",
          "C) Moderately effective",
          "D) Highly effective"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q9",
        "number": "Q9",
        "text": "Which best describes the impact of Lean Startup mentoring on your startup's ability to make informed business decisions?",
        "type": "likert_4",
        "options": [
          "A) No noticeable impact",
          "B) Limited impact",
          "C) Moderate impact",
          "D) Significant impact"
        ],
        "hasOther": false,
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "founders_h1_q10",
        "number": "Q10",
